graph LR
    EvalHubContrib["eval-hub-contrib<br/>Adapter Collection"]

    %% Internal Platform Dependencies
    EvalHubContrib -->|SDK callbacks| EvalHub["eval-hub Service"]
    EvalHubContrib -->|implements| EvalHubSDK["evalhub-sdk ~1.0.5"]

    %% External Python Dependencies (Inspect)
    EvalHubContrib -->|inspect adapter| InspectAI["inspect-ai >=0.3.260"]
    EvalHubContrib -->|alignment auditing| InspectPetri["inspect-petri >=3.0.0"]
    EvalHubContrib -->|scenario gen| PetriBloom["petri-bloom >=0.1.0"]
    EvalHubContrib -->|benchmarks| InspectEvals["inspect-evals >=0.1.0"]
    EvalHubContrib -->|model API| OpenAIPy["openai >=2.0.0"]
    EvalHubContrib -->|NLP data| NLTK["nltk >=3.10.3"]

    %% External Python Dependencies (LightEval)
    EvalHubContrib -->|lighteval adapter| LightEvalLib["lighteval 0.13.0"]
    EvalHubContrib -->|multi-provider LLM| LiteLLM["litellm 1.80.17"]

    %% External Python Dependencies (SWE-bench)
    EvalHubContrib -->|swebench adapter| SWEbenchLib["swebench (bundled)"]

    %% External Services
    EvalHubContrib -->|model inference| OpenAIEndpoint["OpenAI-compatible<br/>Endpoint"]
    EvalHubContrib -->|Claude inference| AnthropicAPI["Anthropic API"]
    EvalHubContrib -->|datasets| HuggingFace["HuggingFace Hub"]
    EvalHubContrib -->|experiment tracking| MLflow["MLflow Server"]
    EvalHubContrib -->|child Jobs| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]

    %% Integration Points
    EvalHubContrib -.->|artifact storage| OCIRegistry["OCI Registry"]

